FILE_DESCRIPTION(('Original JST_XH_B20B-XH-A_1x20_P2.50mm_Vertical model | SPDX-License-Identifier: CERN-OHL-P-2.0 | Copyright 2026 Gerhard Malberg | Source: https://www.jst-mfg.com/product/pdf/eng/eXH.pdf | JST XH series dimensions: 2.50 pitch, contact span A = (n - 1) x 2.50 = 47.50, moulded body B = A + 4.90 = 52.40 x 5.75 offset 2.35 / 3.40 about the contact row, 7.00 shroud above the PCB and 3.40 tails below. The published PDF stores its dimension digits in a font subset that does not extract as text, so these come from the series relations and were cross-checked numerically against an independent public footprint'),'2;1');
